window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/qpu-v25-095-5d5edbf4188d6728.json"]={sha256:"5d5edbf4188d67281d43ef87edcf8473edbcf7b77b54da23c374450f7891d8b9",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v25-case-ddd910c23fc92113","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1912.08854","title":"A Theory of Trotter Error","titleEn":"A Theory of Trotter Error","publisher":"Childs et al. / original research","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-095","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-095","related":[{"id":"qpu-v25-096","referenceUrls":["https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/en/guides/transpile"],"title":"Qiskit 編譯：SWAP 路由與邏輯位置追蹤","titleEn":"Qiskit compilation: SWAP routing and logical-location tracking","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：將演算法界線、實際可觀測量誤差與硬體雜訊分三欄，不能把保守界當實際誤差。 另一位學徒須能從輸入與算式重算，而非僅讀結論。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Separate algorithmic bound, observable error and hardware noise; the bound is not the measured error. A second learner must be able to reconstruct the result from inputs and equations.","difference":"逐步追蹤SWAP後的邏輯位置，區分需要復位與可保留末佈局的情況。","differenceEn":"Track logical locations afterSWAPs, distinguishing restored layouts from permitted final permutations.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["以下情境參數為合成教學輸入，並非案例設備實測或廠商規格；光速、波茲曼常數等標準物理常數另依名稱與單位標明。t=1，交換子範數2，r=10，數值為無因次教學模型。 B誤差=t²×2/(2r)。 代入 1**2*2/(2*10)，得到 0.1 operator-norm error bound。有界Hermitian A、B的實時間一階乘積公式可用t²∥[A,B]∥/(2r)界定算符範數誤差；採ħ=1且哈密頓量單位與t相容。 將式子拆成至少兩個中間欄，逐欄保留單位。","以下情境參數為合成教學輸入，並非案例設備實測或廠商規格；光速、波茲曼常數等標準物理常數另依名稱與單位標明。線形4點0–1–2–3，要在原邏輯q0與q3間作用CNOT；先把q0搬到位置2，允許末佈局改變。 CNOT數=2×3+1。 代入 2*3+1，得到 7 CNOTs。以3個CNOT分解一個SWAP，端點交互需兩個SWAP加1個目標CNOT；若強制復位再多兩個SWAP。 將式子拆成至少兩個中間欄，逐欄保留單位。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Scenario parameters below are synthetic teaching inputs, not measurements or specifications of the named device; standard physical constants such as the speed of light and Boltzmann constant are identified separately by name and unit. Dimensionless teaching inputs:t=1,commutator norm2,r=10. Berror=t²×2/(2r). Substituting 1**2*2/(2*10) gives 0.1 operator-norm error bound. For boundedHermitian A/B, a real-time first-order product formula has the boundt²∥[A,B]∥/(2r); useħ=1 with compatible units. Split the expression into at least two intermediate columns and retain their units.","Scenario parameters below are synthetic teaching inputs, not measurements or specifications of the named device; standard physical constants such as the speed of light and Boltzmann constant are identified separately by name and unit. On line0–1–2–3, applyCNOT between originalq0/q3 by movingq0 to site2, initially allowing changed final layout. CNOT count=2×3+1. Substituting 2*3+1 gives 7 CNOTs. Using3CNOTs perSWAP, endpoint interaction requires twoSWAPs plus one targetCNOT; restoring layout adds two moreSWAPs. Split the expression into at least two intermediate columns and retain their units.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"qpu-v25-005","referenceUrls":["https://qiskit-community.github.io/qiskit-experiments/dev/manuals/characterization/t2ramsey.html"],"title":"Qiskit Ramsey：從 T1 與 T2* 分離純退相位","titleEn":"Qiskit Ramsey: separate pure dephasing from T1 and T2*","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：將演算法界線、實際可觀測量誤差與硬體雜訊分三欄，不能把保守界當實際誤差。 另一位學徒須能從輸入與算式重算，而非僅讀結論。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Separate algorithmic bound, observable error and hardware noise; the bound is not the measured error. A second learner must be able to reconstruct the result from inputs and equations.","difference":"建立『Qiskit Ramsey：從 T1 與 T2* 分離純退相位』可核算的名義與變更模型，區分實際來源背景、合成輸入及驗收證據。成果：交付速率分解表、失效例與量測同步條件。","differenceEn":"Build reproducible nominal and changed models for 'Qiskit Ramsey: separate pure dephasing from T1 and T2*', separating sourced context, synthetic inputs and acceptance evidence. Outcome: Deliver a rate decomposition, invalid example and acquisition-synchronization conditions.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["以下情境參數為合成教學輸入，並非案例設備實測或廠商規格；光速、波茲曼常數等標準物理常數另依名稱與單位標明。t=1，交換子範數2，r=10，數值為無因次教學模型。 B誤差=t²×2/(2r)。 代入 1**2*2/(2*10)，得到 0.1 operator-norm error bound。有界Hermitian A、B的實時間一階乘積公式可用t²∥[A,B]∥/(2r)界定算符範數誤差；採ħ=1且哈密頓量單位與t相容。 將式子拆成至少兩個中間欄，逐欄保留單位。","先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：馬可夫指數模型1/T2=1/(2T1)+1/Tφ；非指數或準靜態雜訊時只是有效參數。 使用合成 T1=100 μs、T2*=80 μs，所有倒數用μs⁻¹。 以手算或試算表計算名義式1/(1/80-1/(2*100))，另開一欄執行獨立核對：將反算的Tφ代回速率總和；再試T2*=250 μs並標記負速率代表模型或量測矛盾。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Scenario parameters below are synthetic teaching inputs, not measurements or specifications of the named device; standard physical constants such as the speed of light and Boltzmann constant are identified separately by name and unit. Dimensionless teaching inputs:t=1,commutator norm2,r=10. Berror=t²×2/(2r). Substituting 1**2*2/(2*10) gives 0.1 operator-norm error bound. For boundedHermitian A/B, a real-time first-order product formula has the boundt²∥[A,B]∥/(2r); useħ=1 with compatible units. Split the expression into at least two intermediate columns and retain their units.","Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: The Markov exponential model gives1/T2=1/(2T1)+1/Tφ; for nonexponential or quasistatic noise this is only effective. Use Synthetic T1=100 μs and T2*=80 μs; all rates use μs⁻¹. Evaluate nominal expression 1/(1/80-1/(2*100)) by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Substitute recovered Tφ into the rate sum; test T2*=250 μs and flag the negative rate as model or measurement inconsistency.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v25-case-d296e8ea181504f2","url":"https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/en/guides/transpile","title":"Introduction to transpilation","titleEn":"Introduction to transpilation","publisher":"IBM Quantum Documentation","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v25-case-df644c33b1c5c68b","url":"https://qiskit-community.github.io/qiskit-experiments/dev/manuals/characterization/t2ramsey.html","title":"T2* Ramsey Characterization","titleEn":"T2* Ramsey Characterization","publisher":"Qiskit Experiments","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
